2. Selective Repeat Sliding Window Protocol (Self-Question 2)
This C program simulates the Selective Repeat protocol. It randomly drops frames during transmission and ensures the sender only retransmits the specific lost frames rather than the entire window, calculating the efficiency at the end.  



